<title>USA: Investor raises American Mobile stake.</title>
<headline>Investor raises American Mobile stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investor Ronald Baron said Friday he had raised his stake in American Mobile Satellite Corp to 3,041,533 shares, or 10.1 percent of the total, up from 8.1 percent held on July 3.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Baron said he bought 397,600 additional shares from July 19 to August 28 at prices ranging from $10.875 to $13.5 per share.</p>
</text>
